+/*
+ * Patch 0298, step 20 before the SQE base (KGSL gen7_start, adreno_gen7.c:519-557):
+ *  - GMU power counter 0 counts GPU busy (521-523): AO GPU_CX_BUSY_MASK 0xff000000, POWER_COUNTER_SELECT_0
+ *    low byte 0x20, POWER_COUNTER_ENABLE 1; read as XOCLK_0 (19.2 MHz ticks while busy) by the DCVS
+ *  - gen7_protect_init (225-258): CP_PROTECT_CNTL BIT(0,1,3), the 45 ranges of gen7_0_0_protected_regs
+ *    (adreno-gpulist.h; gen7_0_1 uses the same list): start [17:0], count [30:18], no-access [31]
+ *  - CP_CHICKEN_DBG, CP_BV_CHICKEN_DBG, CP_LPAC_CHICKEN_DBG = 1 on gen7_0_x (544-549)
+ *  - gen7_hwcg_set(true) (265-300): GMU AO CGC MODE 0x20000, DELAY 0x10111, HYST 0x5555, the 53 registers of
+ *    gen7_0_0_hwcg_regs (the gen7_0_1 entry, adreno-gpulist.h:2079-2110, uses that list), RBBM_CLOCK_CNTL 0x8aa8aa82
